                <head><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article 21, paragraph 6</hi></head>
                <dateline>
                    <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-outside-research" calendar="gregorian"
                        notAfter="1946-10-15T23:59:59+01:00" notBefore="1946-07-29T00:00:00+01:00"
                        >undated</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>Delete the following sentence from paragraph 6 of Article 21: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“<hi rendition="#italic">It being understood that rolling stock shall be
                                regarded as having been removed from the territory to which it
                                originally belonged</hi>.”</p>
                    </quote></p>
            </div>
